  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions as audiovisual hallucination, except that the phantasm includes visual, auditory, olfactory, tactile, and thermal components, and the phantasm follows a complex script. The phantasm follows that script without your concentration and can react to stimuli the targets perceive.",
